      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "SAM One-Click Mask — Segment Anything from a prompt.\n\nFace Detect Lite's bbox_json is wired in as the box prompt, so the mask follows the face automatically. Instead you can type points_json, e.g. [[1200, 1500]] in pixels (positive) and negative_points_json to exclude areas, or connect a rough mask to mask_hint. Mask Cleanup then fills small holes (eyes, shadows) and removes stray specks. Checkpoints live in ComfyUI/models/sams (vit_b ~375 MB, downloaded on first use if missing)."
      ]
    }
